  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Almaty-Bishkek Economic Corridor Regional Improvement of Border Services Project Readiness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity 4, through the engagement of project management consultants and a design firm, will support the preparation of the detailed engineering design (DED) of the project facilities, procurement documents, and due diligence documents of the ensuing Almaty-Bishkek Economic Corridor Regional Improvement of Border Services Project (ABEC RIBS). This will enhance project readiness and improve the executing agency&amp;apos;s capacity to implement the ensuing project.</narrative>
  </description>
